<http://data.silknow.org/event/093b544a-569e-361a-b55d-69380ff10c8a>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased. Registered File number 1985/607. \nThis panel and T.214-1985 are from the collection of Jeffrey Whitehead of Mays, East Grinstead, who was a member of the Burlington Fine Arts Club and who collected a variety of objects d'art in the 1870s and 1880s. The two panels were in an album of lace samples acquired at Christies."@en ;
